<title>USA: BWAY Corp to post $7.7 mln charge in Q4.</title>
<headline>BWAY Corp to post $7.7 mln charge in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>BWAY Corp said Thursday it will record a one-time restructuring charge of $7.7 million after taxes, or $1.22 per share for the year, in its fourth quarter ending September 29.</p>
<p>The charge will cover a one-time write down of out-moded and redundant assets following BWAY's acquisition of Milton Can and Davies Can, which added six additional plants to the company's facilities, BWAY said.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk  (212) 859-1610</p>
